{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"intro","type":"text","text":"## Temporary expiry — pass 5\n\nPlanned: active/queued holds a full hour.\nReplies/actions reset; no activity log.\nInput/approval-only waits count down.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle Design]]","x":0,"y":-450,"width":460,"height":310,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"start","type":"text","text":"## 1 · Live temporary chat\n\nInitialize expiry at creation.\nAgent replies and qualifying chat actions refresh a full hour.\nStore only the current timer value for inactivity tracking.","x":0,"y":0,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"timer","type":"text","text":"## 2 · Active or queued work?\n\nModel/tool work or a pending queued message/request → hold 1:00:00.\nIdle or approval-only wait → countdown.\nFresh hour when no active/queued work remains.","x":500,"y":0,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"check","type":"text","text":"## 3 · Countdown actually due?\n\nNo active/queued work may remain.\nCheck latest timer, retention and run/queue state atomically.\nProtect queued/refreshed/working/kept chats.","x":1000,"y":0,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"expired","type":"text","text":"## 4 · Mark expiring\n\nMake the chat unavailable immediately.\nBlock new runs, actions, approvals, Keep and retrieval.\nCleanup may complete afterward.","x":1500,"y":0,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cancel","type":"text","text":"## 5 · Cancel and settle\n\nCancel pending approvals and residual callbacks/resources.\nManual deletion can stop active/queued work.\nAutomatic expiry reaches only eligible idle or approval-only waits.","x":2000,"y":0,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"cleanup","type":"text","text":"## 6 · Remove local chat state\n\nTranscript, temporary summary and local provider continuation state.\nNo model call needed for cleanup.\nKeep only necessary cleanup markers if retry is needed.","x":2500,"y":0,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"gone","type":"text","text":"## 7 · Chat removed\n\nRemove it from the list.\nIf open, return to the section with a short expiry notice.\nNo late callback may recreate it.","x":3000,"y":0,"width":380,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"live","type":"text","text":"## Active / queued: full hour\n\nHold at 1:00:00 during work and repository/model queues.\nA wait over an hour cannot expire.\nStart a fresh countdown after the last work ends or is cancelled.","x":500,"y":-450,"width":400,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"keep","type":"text","text":"## Keep before expiry\n\nOnly while live and between runs.\nKeep committed first removes expiry.\nAlready expired → cannot Keep.\nIf active, Stop first, then Keep.","x":1000,"y":-450,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"activity","type":"text","text":"## Replies/actions refresh the hour\n\nPrompt or steering message.\nAgent response or qualifying action.\nValid approval/denial, Continue or user Stop.\n\nPassive viewing/typing classification remains proposed.","x":0,"y":550,"width":430,"height":320,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"scope","type":"text","text":"## Temporary retention limits\n\nNo repository edits, durable memory or cross-chat search contributions.\nNo repository rollback in this branch.\nKeep other chats, shared notes and original source files.","x":1000,"y":550,"width":430,"height":320,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"late","type":"text","text":"## Expired means unavailable\n\nLate prompts/decisions cannot revive it.\nReject late model/tool output and approval clicks.\nCleanup retries must not recreate chat content.","x":2000,"y":550,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"offline","type":"text","text":"## Granite was closed\n\nIdle deadlines continue offline.\nHeld active/queued state gets a fresh idle hour after recovery, once.\nNever revive an expired countdown.","x":2500,"y":550,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"manual","type":"text","text":"## Manual temporary deletion\n\nCancel and settle, then clean up.\nNo temporary repository edits exist.\nPermanent coding-chat deletion also keeps edits (D-067).\n[[Run Lifecycle - Chat Deletion.canvas]]","x":3000,"y":550,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"stale_timer","type":"text","text":"## Deadline changed / chat kept\n\nIgnore an obsolete timer.\nUse the latest live countdown.\nKept chats have no expiry.\nExpired chats cannot be revived by a late action.","x":1500,"y":-450,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"minimal_timer","type":"text","text":"## Minimal inactivity state\n\nKeep one current expiry value.\nUse existing run/queue state to hold/display the hour.\nResponses/actions refresh the value.\nNo activity log or per-second writes.","x":500,"y":550,"width":430,"height":300,"color":"6"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"x1","fromNode":"start","fromSide":"right","toNode":"timer","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow"},
		{"id":"x2","fromNode":"timer","fromSide":"right","toNode":"check","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"Idle / approval-only wait"},
		{"id":"x3","fromNode":"check","fromSide":"right","toNode":"expired","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"Countdown due"},
		{"id":"x4","fromNode":"expired","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cancel","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow"},
		{"id":"x5","fromNode":"cancel","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cleanup","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow","label":"Safe cleanup"},
		{"id":"x6","fromNode":"cleanup","fromSide":"right","toNode":"gone","toSide":"left","toEnd":"arrow"},
		{"id":"x7","fromNode":"check","fromSide":"top","toNode":"stale_timer","toSide":"bottom","toEnd":"arrow","label":"No longer due","color":"3"},
		{"id":"x8","fromNode":"timer","fromSide":"top","toNode":"live","toSide":"bottom","toEnd":"arrow","label":"Active / queued work","color":"3"}
	]
}